## register Bash 规则

请求：

```JSON
{
  "action": "register",
  "event": {
    "name": "自定义 Bash 检测",
    "enabled": true,
    "rule": {
      "script_path": "check_custom.sh",
      "op": "boolean_true"
    },
    "alarm": {
      "major_code": "99",
      "minor_code": "900",
      "name": "自定义 Bash 告警",
      "severity": 3,
      "description": "脚本返回 true",
      "recovery": "请查看脚本输出",
      "use_tts": false,
      "audio_path": ""
    }
  }
}
```

响应同 `register`。后端会把规则归一化为：

```JSON
{
  "provider": {
    "tool": "script_bool",
    "script_path": "/absolute/path/config/bash_rules/check_custom.sh"
  },
  "rule": {
    "field": "result",
    "op": "boolean_true"
  }
}
```

## update

更新规则。建议传 `event.id` 定位；也可以传 `event.name` 定位。未传的字段会按已有规则合并。

请求：

```JSON
{
  "action": "update",
  "event": {
    "id": "5c2e1d72-0012-4000-9ca6-0ff1c65ec9c6",
    "enabled": false
  }
}
```

按告警码更新：

```JSON
{
  "action": "update",
  "event": {
    "alarm": {
      "major_code": "10",
      "minor_code": "001"
    },
    "enabled": true
  }
}
```

响应：

```JSON
{
  "success": true,
  "action": "update",
  "message": "event applied, code=10-001",
  "event_id": "5c2e1d72-0012-4000-9ca6-0ff1c65ec9c6",
  "event_name": "电池低电量检测",
  "file_path": "/path/to/user_rules/battery_low.yaml"
}
```

## unregister

注销规则。推荐使用 `event.id`。如果没有 ID，也可以用 `alarm.major_code + alarm.minor_code` 定位。

请求：

```JSON
{
  "action": "unregister",
  "event": {
    "id": "5c2e1d72-0012-4000-9ca6-0ff1c65ec9c6"
  }
}
```

或：

```JSON
{
  "action": "unregister",
  "event": {
    "alarm": {
      "major_code": "10",
      "minor_code": "001"
    }
  }
}
```

响应：

```JSON
{
  "success": true,
  "action": "unregister",
  "message": "event removed, code=10-001",
  "event_id": "5c2e1d72-0012-4000-9ca6-0ff1c65ec9c6",
  "event_name": "电池低电量检测"
}
```
